      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Rec Room nailed it a long time with https://rec.net/ , and even though I'm often skeptical about things, especially as dumb as stupid selfies many degenerates love taking so much, and I still think they can improve their system even better since it's not exactly perfect, I'm a huge fan of their work. I really doubt a system like this would be one of the first priorities for the developers of VRChat at this point, but I guess it would be okay to have it. At very least I'd like to have an ability to post pictures directly to Twitter or Instagram, there's no way there's a simpler solution to this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
