      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A mailing system would be nice, such as the one proposed here:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/mailbox-messaging-system\n\nI keep having to invite people to my discord that I sometimes have to make them go through my Twitch to find me that I would much prefer a bio listed in social how people can contact you or something to share these. In game mailing system, or something. \n\nA message board in worlds where images can be posted up (+18 lewds would still get you banned that it should still be scanned by the VRchat system/filter). I guess the best option would be to give us a bio next to our avatar & such telling people how to contact you.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-24T22:24:15.229Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Often players take group photos or just pictures overall and want to share them with friends or strangers who are in the picture, but apart from linking discord there is really no easy way. It would be great if we got a picture share option were players could send and receive taken screenshots.",
